<title>SWEDEN: Finnish airports move 13.7 percent more cargo in April.</title>
<headline>Finnish airports move 13.7 percent more cargo in April.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's domestic and international airports handled 7,257 tonnes of freight in April, a 13.7 percent rise on the same month a year ago, Finland's civil aviation administration said on Friday.</p>
<p>The administration published the following figures about airport activity.</p>
<p>					  APRIL		 JAN-APRIL</p>
<p>				  1997    Pct change   1997  Pct change</p>
<p> Cargo (in tonnes)	  7,257	 13.7    29,871	 7.1</p>
<p> Mail (in tonnes)	   1,571	  7.8     6,361	 2.3</p>
<p> Landings		    24,674	 -3.9    81,860	-6.3</p>
<p> Passengers (in millions) 1.013	 12.4     3.721	 7.4</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
